 == CC Conformance Claims
 As defined by the references <<CC1>>, <<CC2>>, <<CC3>>, and <<CC-E&I>> this cPP:
 
-* conforms to the requirements of Common Criteria CC:2022, Release 1,
-* Errata and Interpretation for CC:2022 (Release 1) and CEM:2022 (Release 1), 002, Version 1.1
