+The Common Criteria Part 2 component FPT_TST.1 also addresses TSF self-testing. However, FPT_TST.1 is defined as a three-element component. When claimed, it also requires verification of the integrity of TSF data and stored TSF executable code. These elements cannot be omitted. As a result, FPT_TST.1 cannot clearly express the intended cPP requirement without importing additional mandatory requirements that are outside the intended baseline.
