+This cPP establishes a security baseline that requires demonstration of correct TSF operation at start-up. It does not mandate general verification of TSF-data integrity across all conformant TOEs. Therefore, FPT_TST_EXT.1 is necessary to state the intended baseline requirement precisely, without importing FPT_TST.1 elements that are either already addressed by FPT_SBT_EXT.1 or outside the intended baseline. The extended component is placed in the FPT class as a single component.
 
